Z||000006||Philphine||03-07-2001||03:59 PM||||when the '85 gt first came out i read it was about 150lbs. more than a coupe. some of that was body mods but most i read was engine.<P>as for the rest:<BR>a 2.8 and 3.4 should weight about the same.<P>a 3.8 i think i read weights a little more don't know how much.<P>a 4.9 caddy engine i've heard wieghts as much without ac as a 2.8 dose with it.<P>a 350 sbc weights about 80 lbs more than a 2.8. ok now that i think about it, that how i know there a difference bettween the 2.8 and 2.5. i think in the v8 archie info pages it says a v8 adds 150lbs to a 4cyl conversion and about 80lbs to a v6 conversion.<P>hope that didn't cloud things up too much.||||reg||1
